<!-- Ball "sports" mark: an outer ball with the classic centre pentagon and five seams
     running out to the rim. The ball is the one glyph that reads as sport at tab size
     without naming a single one of them, which matters here - the tab lists whatever
     feeds the build carries, football and ice hockey included. Same stroke language as
     the other tab icons (1.8dp, round caps/joins); the colour is tinted at usage sites.
     All geometry inset >=2.9dp from the viewport edges so the stroke never clips. -->
